OL,3,ARussian strikes cut power to thousands
OL,4,Ain Ukraine as Kherson ceasefire ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Air Force message read: "The Air
OL,7,FAlarm application has probably been
OL,8,Fsubjected to hostile interference.
OL,9,FThere is no radiation threat! Stay calm
OL,10,Fand follow our updates on our channel."
